<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian economy to strengthen in '97 - govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian economy to strengthen in '97 - govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday the domestic economy would strengthen through 1997 but he again declined to comment on interest rates.</p>
<p>&quot;Our assessment (is) that the economy will strengthen throughout 1997,&quot; Costello said in an interview on Australian Broadcasting Corp radio.</p>
</text>
